```php
namespace Commerz\Sales\Gateways\Contracts;

/** Платёжный шлюз, вклад kind `payment_gateway`. Вызывается только sales и только вне транзакции БД. */
#[Spi(kind: SpiKind::Implement, since: '0.1')]
interface PaymentGateway
{
    public const string KIND = 'payment_gateway';
    public function key(): string;                                              // 'manual', 'acme.pay'
    /** Идемпотентно по $request->reference у провайдера (адаптер передаёт reference как ключ идемпотентности/metadata). @throws PaymentDeclined окончательный отказ */
    public function initiate(GatewayPaymentRequest $request): GatewayPaymentResult;
    /** Сверка неизвестного исхода: текущее состояние у провайдера; null — провайдер такой попытки не знает. */
    public function find(string $reference): ?GatewayPaymentResult;
    /** Идемпотентно по $request->reference. @throws PaymentDeclined окончательный отказ в возврате */
    public function refund(GatewayRefundRequest $request): GatewayRefundResult;
    public function findRefund(string $reference): ?GatewayRefundResult;
}
```
Данные (`Gateways/Data`, `final readonly`, валидация формы в конструкторе, коды `sales.invalid_gateway_*`):
- `GatewayPaymentRequest(string $reference, string $orderRef, string $orderNumber, Money $amount, ?CustomerRef $customer, ?string $customerEmail, array<string, scalar> $meta)` — `meta` из `InitiatePayment` (return_url и т.п.).
- `GatewayPaymentResult(GatewayPaymentStatus $status, ?string $externalId = null, ?Money $authorized = null, ?Money $captured = null, ?string $actionUrl = null, array<string, scalar> $meta = [])`; `GatewayPaymentStatus`: `Pending, RequiresAction, Authorized, Captured, Failed, Cancelled`.
- `GatewayRefundRequest(string $reference, string $paymentReference, ?string $paymentExternalId, Money $amount, ?string $reason)`; `GatewayRefundResult(GatewayRefundStatus $status, ?string $externalId = null, array<string, scalar> $meta = [])`; `GatewayRefundStatus`: `Pending, Succeeded, Failed`.
- Исключения: `PaymentDeclined(string $gateway, string $reason)` (category conflict, `sales.payment_declined`) — окончательный отказ, попытка → `failed`; `InvalidGatewayResult(string $gateway, string $reason)` (integration, `sales.invalid_gateway_result`) — результат нарушает контракт; исход считается неизвестным.
- Проверка результата (в workflow, не в DTO): `externalId` null или 1..191 байт печатного UTF-8; суммы в валюте заказа, `0 ≤ captured ≤ amount`, `0 ≤ authorized ≤ amount`; `actionUrl` null или `https?://`, ≤ 2048; `meta` — словарь string → scalar, JSON-представимый; `RequiresAction` требует `actionUrl`.

Встроенный `manual` (`Gateways/Internal/ManualGateway`, оффлайн/счёт): `initiate` → `Pending` без сети (externalId = null, meta `['instructions' => 'offline']`); `find` → `Pending` для любого reference (состояние живёт только у нас; деньги фиксирует оператор событием `Captured`); `refund` → `Succeeded` (оффлайн-возврат проведён оператором); `findRefund` → `Succeeded`.

```php
namespace Commerz\Sales\Numbering\Contracts;

/** Номер заказа, вклад kind `order_number_generator`; вызывается внутри транзакции размещения, без сети. */
#[Spi(kind: SpiKind::Implement, since: '0.1')]
interface OrderNumberGenerator
{
    public const string KIND = 'order_number_generator';
    public function key(): string;
    /** Видимый номер `[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]{0,63}`, уникальный в магазине. */
    public function next(OrderNumbering $numbering): string;
}
// OrderNumbering(StoreView $store, ChannelId $channel, OrderId $orderId, DateTimeImmutable $at)
```
Встроенный `sequence` (`Numbering/Internal/SequenceOrderNumbers`, D34): `select nextval('<prefix>order_number_seq')` на соединении Commerz → `$store->orderNumberPrefix.$n` (префикс уже `[A-Z0-9-]{0,16}`). Пропуски после отката допустимы; номер заказа ≠ номер счёта. Результат генератора проверяется `OrderPlacement`: шаблон → иначе `InvalidOrderNumber` (configuration); нарушение `UNIQUE(store_id, number)` (вставка заказа во вложенном `Transactions::run`, SQLSTATE 23505 по этому ограничению) → `DuplicateOrderNumber` (conflict) и откат всего размещения.

`SalesPlugin` (`Internal/SalesPlugin`, id `commerz.sales`, версия `0.1.0`): `declareKind(new ContributionKind(PaymentGateway::KIND, PaymentGateway::class, self::ID))`, то же для `OrderNumberGenerator`; `contribute` `ManualGateway`, `SequenceOrderNumbers`. Генератор по ключу `SalesConfig::$numberGenerator` резолвится через `Contributions::get(...)` при размещении (неизвестный ключ → `UnsupportedContribution`, размещение откатывается).

```php
use Commerz\Sales\Facades\Sales;   // корень Commerz\Sales\Sales: carts(), checkout(), orders(), payments(), fulfillments(), returns(), refunds()

$cart = Sales::carts()->create(new CreateCart($ctx));
$cart = Sales::carts()->addLine(new AddCartLine($cart->id, SellableRef::of('variant', $v), quantity: 2));
Sales::carts()->enterCode(new EnterCode($cart->id, 'AUTUMN'));
Sales::carts()->setAddress(new SetCartAddress($cart->id, AddressRole::Shipping, $address));
$options = Sales::carts()->deliveryOptions($cart->id);                 // list<DeliveryOption>
Sales::carts()->selectDelivery(new SelectDelivery($cart->id, 'courier'));
$quote = Sales::carts()->quote($cart->id);                            // QuoteResult

$order = Sales::checkout()->place(new PlaceOrder($cart->id, expectedTotal: $quote->total, idempotencyKey: IdempotencyKey::of($key)));
$payment = Sales::payments()->initiate(new InitiatePayment($order->id, gateway: 'manual'));      // вне транзакции
Sales::payments()->recordEvent(new RecordPaymentEvent('manual', 'bank-tx-42', PaymentEventType::Captured, paymentReference: $payment->reference));
Sales::payments()->reconcile(new ReconcilePayment($payment->id));

$f = Sales::fulfillments()->create(new CreateFulfillment($order->id, [new LineQuantity($lineId, 2)], locationCode: 'main'));
Sales::fulfillments()->book(new BookFulfillment($f->id));             // или ship(new ShipFulfillment($f->id, 'manual', 'RB123'))
Sales::orders()->cancel(new CancelOrder($order->id, CancelReason::Customer));
$r = Sales::returns()->request(new RequestReturn($order->id, [new LineQuantity($lineId, 1)], reason: 'defect'));
Sales::returns()->receive(new ReceiveReturn($r->id, restock: []));    // приёмка ≠ возврат на сток
Sales::refunds()->issue(new IssueRefund($order->id, Money::of('1990.00', 'RUB')));

// CRM
$draft = Sales::orders()->draft(new DraftOrder($ctx, [new DraftLine(SellableRef::of('crm.service', '77'), 1)], actor: $manager));
$order = Sales::checkout()->place(new PlaceOrder($draft->id, expectedTotal: Sales::carts()->quote($draft->id)->total));
```
`Orders`: `draft`, `find(OrderId)`, `findByNumber(StoreId, string)`, `list(ListOrders(?ChannelId, ?CustomerRef, ?OrderState, ?PaymentState, ?FulfillmentState, ?Cursor, int $limit = 50))` (keyset `placed_at DESC, id DESC`), `history(OrderId): list<OrderEventView>`, `cancel`, `cancelLines`, `expireDue`.
`OrderView(OrderId $id, string $number, StoreId $store, ChannelId $channel, CartId $cart, CartKind $origin, OrderState $state, PaymentState $paymentState, FulfillmentState $fulfillmentState, ?CancelReason $cancelReason, Currency $currency, string $locale, ?CustomerRef $customer, list<string> $customerGroups, ?string $customerEmail, ?string $customerName, list<OrderLineView> $lines, list<Adjustment> $orderAdjustments, ?DeliveryCharge $delivery, list<Adjustment> $deliveryAdjustments, list<TaxLine> $deliveryTaxLines, QuoteTotals $totals, Money $amountDue, Money $authorized, Money $captured, Money $refunded, list<string> $codes, ?Address $shippingAddress, ?Address $billingAddress, string $quoteFingerprint, ?DateTimeImmutable $paymentDueAt, DateTimeImmutable $placedAt, ?DateTimeImmutable $completedAt, ?DateTimeImmutable $cancelledAt)`; `$total` — свойство = `$totals->total`.
`OrderLineView(OrderLineId $id, SellableRef $sellable, string $sku, string $name, SellableKind $kind, bool $requiresShipping, array<string,string> $options, ?string $taxClass, ?int $weightGrams, int $quantity, Money $unitPrice, ?Money $compareAt, bool $taxIncluded, string $priceSource, Money $subtotal, list<Adjustment> $adjustments, list<TaxLine> $taxLines, Money $total, int $cancelledQuantity, int $fulfilledQuantity, int $returnedQuantity)` + `outstanding(): int`.
`OrderLineId` — `EntityId`; `LineQuantity(OrderLineId $lineId, int $quantity ≥ 1)`.

Отличия от knowledge/api-blueprint#sales (deviation в P7.9): черновик — корзина `kind draft`, нет `OrderState::Draft` (D31); `CreateFulfillment(lines: list<LineQuantity>, locationCode)` вместо `[[lineId, qty]]`/`location: id`; `ReceiveReturn(restock: list<LineQuantity>)`; `IssueRefund(order, amount, ?payment)` вместо `gateway:` (шлюз — у платежа); `RecordPaymentEvent(…, paymentReference|externalPaymentId)`; добавлены `deliveryOptions`, `reconcile`, `book`, `markDelivered`, `cancelLines`, `expireDue`, `history`, `refunds()->recordEvent`.

**Коды ошибок** (подклассы ядра `NotFound`/`InvalidCommand`/`CommerzException`; категория в скобках): `sales.cart_not_found`, `sales.order_not_found`, `sales.payment_not_found`, `sales.refund_not_found`, `sales.fulfillment_not_found`, `sales.return_not_found`, `sales.line_not_found`, `sales.cart_line_not_found` (not_found); `sales.cart_not_open`, `sales.cart_changed`, `sales.cart_already_placed`, `sales.quote_changed`, `sales.order_not_cancellable`, `sales.order_not_payable`, `sales.order_not_fulfillable`, `sales.payment_exceeds_balance`, `sales.payment_in_progress`, `sales.refund_exceeds_balance`, `sales.refund_in_progress`, `sales.quantity_exceeds_outstanding`, `sales.return_exceeds_fulfilled`, `sales.restock_exceeds_received`, `sales.return_not_open`, `sales.fulfillment_already_shipped`, `sales.fulfillment_not_shipped`, `sales.fulfillment_not_bookable`, `sales.duplicate_order_number`, `sales.payment_declined` (conflict); `sales.cart_empty`, `sales.sellable_not_purchasable`, `sales.shipping_address_required`, `sales.delivery_required`, `sales.too_many_cart_lines`, `sales.invalid_payment_event`, формы `sales.invalid_*` (validation); `sales.operation_inside_transaction`, `sales.invalid_order_number` (configuration); `sales.payment_outcome_unknown`, `sales.refund_outcome_unknown`, `sales.invalid_gateway_result` (integration). Из ядра — `common.idempotency_conflict`, `stock.insufficient_stock`, `promotions.usage_limit_reached`, `quotes.failed`, `sellables.*`, `stores.*`, `plugins.unsupported_contribution`.

**Доменные события** (после коммита, `CommittedEvents`): `OrderPlaced(OrderId, string $number)`, `OrderCancelled(OrderId, CancelReason)`, `OrderCompleted(OrderId)`, `OrderPaymentStateChanged(OrderId, PaymentState $from, PaymentState $to)`, `PaymentStatusChanged(PaymentId, OrderId, PaymentStatus)`, `PaymentRequiresRefund(OrderId, PaymentId, Money $captured)`, `RefundStatusChanged(RefundId, OrderId, RefundStatus)`, `FulfillmentCreated(FulfillmentId, OrderId)`, `FulfillmentShipped(FulfillmentId, OrderId, ?string $tracking)`, `ReturnReceived(ReturnId, OrderId)`.
**Outbox** (`IntegrationEvent::of(type, 'order:'.$id, payload)`, версия 1, в той же транзакции): `sales.order_placed`, `sales.order_cancelled`, `sales.order_completed`, `sales.payment_state_changed`, `sales.payment_requires_refund`, `sales.fulfillment_shipped`, `sales.return_received`, `sales.refund_succeeded`. Payload — скаляры (`order_id`, `number`, суммы `*_minor` + `currency`, состояния строками).
